@startuml SEQ_03_SCAN_QR_PUBLIK
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-03: Melihat Detail Aset via Scan QR

actor       "Publik / Asisten"           as User
boundary    "Browser"                    as Browser
control     "InventarisController" as Controller
entity      "Aset Model"           as ModelDA

== Scan QR Code — Lihat Detail Publik ==

User    -> Browser     : Scan QR code pada aset

Browser -> Controller  : GET /aset/{id}/detail

Controller -> ModelDA  : Query detail aset
ModelDA --> Controller : Data aset
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman publik detail aset
Browser --> User       : Tampil detail aset: nama, kategori, kondisi, lab, riwayat kondisi

@enduml